DTSTAMP:20261118T195632Z
DTSTART:20261201T080000
DTEND:20261201T200000
SUMMARY:Giving BLUEday
DESCRIPTION:Join the movement for Giving BLUEday\, Shady Side Academy's annual 24-hour celebration of Bulldog pride and generosity! On this special day of giving\, we invite parents\, alumni\, faculty\, staff\, and friends to come together in support of the Blue & Gold Fund\, which supports the people experiences that make Shady Side exceptional. Every gift counts\, and every Bulldog can make a difference. Blue is back and ready to make his next move. Are you? Make your move here: https://shadysi.de/giving-blueday
LOCATION:Hillman Center - HCPA Wean Room
PRIORITY:0
END:VEVENT
