DTEND:20261201T130000
SUMMARY:Senior Parent Program - Hearing the News
DESCRIPTION:Join Director of Personal Counseling\, Dr. Claudia Henry\, as well as Director of College Counseling\, Meg Scott\, along with other members of the College Counseling team\, for a thoughtful and timely discussion of how parents can support their students as they "hear the news" of early college results. (This program will be held virtually\, with a link to be provided at a later date.)
