DTEND:20261204T213000
SUMMARY:Senior School Bands and River City Brass Concert
DESCRIPTION:As part of the Hillman Performing Arts Series\, Shady Side Academy's Senior School bands share the stage with members of River City Brass\, Pittsburgh's acclaimed professional brass band\, for an evening of side-by-side music making in the Richard E. Rauh Theater. The Symphonic Band\, Jazz Ensemble\, and Jazz Combo perform alongside these professional musicians in a program that ranges from concert band and jazz favorites to music of the holiday season. Admission is free\, and all are welcome.
LOCATION:Hillman Center - HCPA Green Room\, HCPA Lower Lobby\, HCPA Rauh Theater\, HCPA Upper Lobby
PRIORITY:0
