UID:129925076@www.shadysideacademy.org
DTSTAMP:20261118T195632Z
DTSTART:20270130T100000
DTEND:20270130T153000
SUMMARY:Math Olympiad (SSAMO)
DESCRIPTION:The Shady Side Academy Math Olympiad (SSAMO) will be hosted on Saturday\, January 30th from 10am to 3:30pm in the Senior School Library. Throughout the day\, there will be four separate rounds\, some individual\, some team based\, for participants to explore the intricacies of different math topics\, ranging from geometry to algebra to trigonometry and more! There will also be an award ceremony with prizes for top scoring contestants! Any student in grades 9 - 12 are welcome to register via the form found on our website: https://sites.google.com/view/ssamo-ssa-mathematics-olympiad/the-tournament This event is entirely student created\, scheduled\, and run by members of the SSA Math Team\, led by Alex Chen '27. Please reach out to Ms. Boyer with further questions or wonderings.
LOCATION:Upper School Campus - SS Memorial Library
PRIORITY:0
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:129925229@www.shadysideacademy.org
DTSTAMP:20261118T195632Z
DTSTART:20270130T110000
DTEND:20270130T133000
SUMMARY:Goldstein Test Prep - Practice Tests
DESCRIPTION:Shady Side students will have the opportunity to take a free SAT and/or ACT practice test through Goldstein Test Prep. Students are welcome to try an SAT and an ACT in consecutive weekends to determine which might be the better fit. Tests are free to attend\, but please reserve a spot by registering with Mike Goldstein at mike.goldstein@goldsteintestprep.com or calling 412-874-7645.
LOCATION:Upper School Campus - SS Rowe 201\, SS Rowe 202
PRIORITY:0
END:VEVENT
